5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. Let's try to get along and find the werewolf together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so ready for this! I'll find the bad guy in no time!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Me too! This is like a real detective game!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep things logical. Emotional outbursts won't help us find the wolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, Shion. I shall be observing the flow of conversation with interest.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Since it's the first day, perhaps we should just observe each other?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, you're so calm! Are you the one who knows everything?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,Maybe Rin is the werewolf and is trying to distract us! Hehe!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, baseless accusations are inefficient. We have no data yet.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is far too early to cast suspicion. I suggest we remain patient.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
