31,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Everyone, I have something important to tell you. Sakura is the werewolf.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! Sakura? No way, she's too cute to be a wolf!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! Midori-san, why are you saying that? I'm just a villager!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A claim on the first possible moment. Midori, are you the Seer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,This is a very bold opening. The game has accelerated quite rapidly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Yes, I am the Seer. I checked Sakura last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Sakura is my friend! Maybe the Seer is actually the werewolf lying?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm innocent! I promise! Midori-san is making a mistake!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"If Midori is the Seer, the logic is simple: we execute Sakura.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While a fake Seer is possible, Midori's demeanor is remarkably sincere.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I cannot lie about this. For the village to win, we must act now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,I don't know... this is so scary!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Please don't believe her! I'm just a normal girl!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, emotions are a liability here. The Seer's information is our only tool.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I find myself agreeing with Shion. The risk of ignoring a true Seer is too high.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
